# A Bridge to the Future: Observations on Building a Digital Library.

**Authors:** Gaunt, Marianne I.

## Abstract
The experience of Rutgers University Libraries illustrates the extensive planning, work effort, possibilities, and investment required to develop the digital library. Examines these key areas: organizational structure; staff development needs; facilities and the new digital infrastructure; metadata standards/interoperability; digital collection development; copyright and intellectual property. (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ649105

